      en: ["The residence was completed in 1838 for the ruling prince-bishop.", "Named after the country's first billiard table, brought from Vienna in 1839.", "Houses the original manuscript of the epic poem 'The Mountain Wreath'.", "Features a 1:10,000 scale relief map of Montenegro created in 1916.", "The fortress-style walls were designed to protect the leadership from invaders.", "Served as the seat of the Senate and the highest state authority under Njegoš."],
